Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 20:09:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] Sabi: add shared site config, content data and marketing
 components

Centralise routes, nav and footer config in lib/sabi/site.ts, all page copy
in lib/sabi/content.ts and per-page metadata in lib/sabi/metadata.ts. Add
reusable Section/PageHeader/FeaturePhone/DataBlocks/Blocks/VideoFacade
components, rebuild the nav (desktop + accessible mobile menu) and the
config-driven footer, and extend the design system CSS.
